SynthSeg browser processing library
Copyright 2026 Neurodesk contributors

Port of SynthSeg 2.0 (https://github.com/BBillot/SynthSeg, Apache-2.0) as shipped
in FreeSurfer 8.1.0 `mri_synthseg`. Preprocessing and postprocessing are the
native CLI's Rust modules (exes/synthseg/src) compiled to WebAssembly, so results
are bit-identical. Model checkpoint: synthseg_2.0.h5, re-exported to ONNX without
retraining.

Billot B, Greve DN, Puonti O, et al. (2023). SynthSeg: Segmentation of brain
MRI scans of any contrast and resolution without retraining. Medical Image
Analysis 86:102789. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.media.2023.102789
